## 🔌 ESP32 to PCA9685 Wiring

The ESP32 communicates with the PCA9685 servo driver using the I2C protocol.

| ESP32 Pin | PCA9685 Pin |
| --------- | ----------- |
| GPIO 21   | SDA         |
| GPIO 22   | SCL         |
| 3.3V      | VCC         |
| GND       | GND         |

The servo motors are connected to the PWM channels of the PCA9685 module.

